"ARC or PLC in Ashland County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/ashland-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids came in under 90% of normal in January to February in 38 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2026 so far, the middle ran 58% of normal in May to June 2026 and 67% in June to July 2026. Every grid in the table had its driest year in 1976, and grid 31057 got down to 62% of normal that year.</p>"}
